{
  "name": "Retell AI call summary to Google Sheets",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Retell AI call summary to Google Sheets\n\n**What it does**\nEvery call your Retell AI receptionist finishes becomes a clean row in Google Sheets: who called, why, a short summary and how hot the lead is. Hot leads also ping your sales channel in Slack.\n\n**You need**\n- A Retell AI agent with a phone number\n- OpenAI API key\n- Google Sheets and Slack connected to n8n\n\n**Setup**\n1. Create a Google Sheet with a tab named `Calls` and the headers listed in the README. Paste its ID into **Log the call in Google Sheets**.\n2. Pick your Slack channel in **Alert sales in Slack** and connect OpenAI, Google Sheets and Slack credentials.\n3. Activate the workflow, copy the production URL of **Retell call webhook** and paste it into your Retell agent's webhook URL.\n\nBuilt by AI Strike Force, aistrikeforce.com",
        "height": 720,
        "width": 560
      },
      "id": "93f78364-8f67-5162-8b3f-fe1542aa7a0e",
      "name": "Retell AI call summary to Google Sheets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -620,
        -320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Edit me\n**Log the call in Google Sheets**: put your sheet ID here.\n**Alert sales in Slack**: pick the channel.\n\nWant different lead rules? Edit the descriptions in **Extract summary and lead fields**.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "0a3c37fb-a4cf-53ee-b890-e7f5f614df8c",
      "name": "Edit me: sheet and channel",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        640,
        -320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "retell-call-events",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "03d59d71-0290-588e-a3d1-639191d41d3b",
      "name": "Retell call webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "4dfab2da-b029-51a5-b5ee-5efcce869687"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c85d87b9-8630-5bfa-91eb-4ad7cbfdd4c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.event }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              },
              "rightValue": "call_ended"
            },
            {
              "id": "298ca34b-45ea-5d7e-9b05-9739648a8f4e",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.call.transcript }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              },
              "rightValue": ""
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "0ea41b37-d7c5-5045-b68d-c393ca9841cc",
      "name": "Only finished calls with a transcript",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "text": "=Phone call transcript between our AI receptionist (\"Agent\") and a caller (\"User\"):\n\n{{ $json.body.call.transcript }}",
        "attributes": {
          "attributes": [
            {
              "name": "caller_name",
              "description": "The caller's name if they said it, otherwise empty"
            },
            {
              "name": "caller_email",
              "description": "Email address the caller gave, otherwise empty"
            },
            {
              "name": "reason_for_call",
              "description": "What the caller wants, in under 12 words"
            },
            {
              "name": "summary",
              "description": "Two or three sentence summary of the call for a busy owner",
              "required": true
            },
            {
              "name": "lead_temperature",
              "description": "hot = ready to buy or book now, warm = interested but not urgent, cold = not a prospect (wrong number, spam, existing customer admin)",
              "required": true
            },
            {
              "name": "next_step",
              "description": "The one thing our team should do next, in under 15 words",
              "required": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "systemPromptTemplate": "You read phone call transcripts for a small business and fill in the requested fields. Use only facts stated in the call. Leave a field empty when the caller did not say it. lead_temperature must be exactly hot, warm or cold."
        }
      },
      "id": "03711eba-6d1b-51a2-b47f-e6b958a176f9",
      "name": "Extract summary and lead fields",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.informationExtractor",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "gpt-4.1-mini",
          "cachedResultName": "gpt-4.1-mini"
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0
        }
      },
      "id": "68590cd4-edb5-598c-8701-3c1aa27a49a8",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        440,
        220
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "name": "OpenAI account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "56168894-481e-5e9b-9a94-74df94f46cdf",
              "name": "Date",
              "value": "={{ DateTime.fromMillis($('Retell call webhook').item.json.body.call.start_timestamp).setZone($now.zone).toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm') }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "8442d9b6-8a7a-58ca-a305-24670d29171e",
              "name": "Call ID",
              "value": "={{ $('Retell call webhook').item.json.body.call.call_id }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "12d48a9c-97fd-508e-8c81-9c308a9d4f60",
              "name": "From",
              "value": "={{ $('Retell call webhook').item.json.body.call.from_number }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "21fe454e-15a8-50eb-9e45-4f3a2d17684b",
              "name": "To",
              "value": "={{ $('Retell call webhook').item.json.body.call.to_number }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "f3961635-682e-51fe-96c0-077c78ee175c",
              "name": "Direction",
              "value": "={{ $('Retell call webhook').item.json.body.call.direction }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "5c3f534e-48f8-5821-9edc-4e01aa531763",
              "name": "Duration (sec)",
              "value": "={{ Math.round(($('Retell call webhook').item.json.body.call.end_timestamp - $('Retell call webhook').item.json.body.call.start_timestamp) / 1000) }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "f558f0d5-7f0a-5439-aa94-69b154d772ba",
              "name": "Ended by",
              "value": "={{ $('Retell call webhook').item.json.body.call.disconnection_reason }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "aa687dea-6784-56c8-8c24-5803a5409bfd",
              "name": "Caller name",
              "value": "={{ $json.output.caller_name }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "dc9adb6d-0a28-56c6-bc96-b3dc3becd500",
              "name": "Email",
              "value": "={{ $json.output.caller_email }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "d64d2acd-28fb-5c32-873f-cb5c57fb6299",
              "name": "Reason",
              "value": "={{ $json.output.reason_for_call }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "fea0182a-0906-5f0c-b042-4f9c56758620",
              "name": "Summary",
              "value": "={{ $json.output.summary }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "09ebde13-9f58-5fdd-95dc-eafae7963b35",
              "name": "Lead temperature",
              "value": "={{ ($json.output.lead_temperature || '').toLowerCase().trim() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c2d8af24-aac0-5112-a063-3ad47ed74de2",
              "name": "Next step",
              "value": "={{ $json.output.next_step }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a5924bc6-3e67-550c-9636-2abe70fb5215",
      "name": "Shape the call row",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
